  [OK] include/dt-bindings/clock/thead,th1520-clk-ap.h:121-126  
      These are six #define constants (CLK_IOPMP_VOSYS_DPU_PCLK through CLK_IOPMP_GPU_ACLK) for DT clock binding IDs. They are purely numeric identifiers with no hardware-state interpretation. No status/valid bit is read here.
  [OK] drivers/clk/thead/clk-th1520-ap.c:1250-1261  
